WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Food Waste Reduction and Donation System.
Turning surplus food into support.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Good food can go to waste.
Without organized coordination, surplus food may not reach
people who need it in time.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Step 1: Donors.
Donors register, sign in, and add donations
with food details, quantities, and freshness information.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 2: Distribution.
Distribution staff review donations, prioritize urgent food,
and organize delivery to a distribution center.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Step 3: Tracking.
Each donation moves through three statuses:
Available, Assigned, and Delivered.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Less waste. Better coordination.
Connecting donors, food records, and distribution workflows.
